@startuml
 title Resumefolio - Schedule reconciliation after analysis and design
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  FontColor #17324D
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
  DiamondBorderColor #94A3B8
  StartColor #17324D
  EndColor #17324D
}
start
:Review analysis/design and unresolved findings;
:Break scope into estimable work and prerequisites;
:Establish usable solo capacity;
:Include learning, implementation, integration,\nverification, documentation and rework;
:Estimate ranges and compare forecast with requested target;
if (Conflict with target or available resources?) then (yes)
  :Record evidence, options and consequences;
  :Project owner decides material changes;
else (no identified conflict)
  :Record estimate basis and remaining uncertainty;
endif
:Reconcile backlog, Sprints, milestones and live tracking;
:Record agreed forecast and pre-implementation baseline;
:During execution, revise using actual progress;
stop
legend bottom
Existing dates remain provisional until this review occurs.
Do not silently remove scope or bypass verification to preserve a target.
This diagram does not perform rescheduling or authorize product coding now.
endlegend
@enduml
